ard":false,"firstImg":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40965b2c1ea3fa51ee8.jpeg","rawTitle":"庞氏工资！！！","tagStr":"","longTextForIOS":false,"topic_pic_thumbnail_small":null,"topic_pic_thumbnail":null,"topic_pic_headOrPad":null,"tagsForWeb":";","reply_count":2,"meta_keywords":"{\"stockCorrelation\":\"SH601995_03908\",\"stockList\":\"SH601995_11,03908_30\"}","paid_mention":null,"reward_count":0,"reward_amount":0,"reward_user_count":0,"talk_count":0,"like_count":14,"video_info":null,"quote_cards":null,"promotion_pic":null,"promotion_url":null,"promotion_id":0,"mark_desc":null,"pic_sizes":[{"width":1080,"height":400},{"width":64,"height":64},{"width":64,"height":64},{"width":64,"height":64},{"width":64,"height":64},{"width":64,"height":64}],"cover_pic_size":null,"order_id":0,"tags":[],"status_industry":null,"excellent_comments":[],"notice_tag":null,"common_emotion":null,"current_stock_price":null,"new_card":null,"source_deep_link":null,"source_feed":false,"editable":true,"like_config":null,"title_ad_pic":null,"title_ad_url":null,"title_ad_deep_link":null,"answer_comment":null,"answer_count":0,"answer_users":null,"bonus_screen_name":null,"fundx_tag":null,"extend_st_feed_info":{"stock_event_time":0,"stock_event_type":null,"change_event_color":null,"is_future_event":false,"stock_event_id":null,"stock_event_message":null,"original_text_length":1231,"disputed_status":false,"excellent_status":"false"},"stock_list":[{"symbol":"SH601995","type":"11"},{"symbol":"03908","type":"30"}],"reply_user_images":null,"reply_user_count":0,"fundx_symbol":null,"hot_new_rank":null,"image_info_list":[{"filename":"1836b40965b2c1ea3fa51ee8.jpeg","width":1080,"height":400,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1836b409e4b2c3d33fe4dbf9.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"1836b40b9172ca533fe43b4c.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null}],"extend_st_home_page":{"ip_location":"","st_mention_stock_count":2,"ai_card":null,"ai_status":false,"speech_enable":false,"speech_info":null},"censor_state":0,"vod_info":null,"forbidden_retweet":false,"is_answer":false,"is_refused":false,"text":"<p><b> 点击下方卡片关注我 </b></p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40965b2c1ea3fa51ee8.jpeg\" /></p> <p>9月13日晚间，<a href=\"https://xueqiu.com/S/SH601995?from=status_stock_match\" class=\"xq_stock\">中金公司</a>披露2022年拟采用配售股份方式，募集资金不超过人民币270亿元。连人均薪酬百万的中金公司都差钱，要募资，简直要惊掉下巴了。给高管开出天价工资，普通员工都是百万年薪，然后，没钱了就募资！这玩法，真厉害。我以前提出过庞氏分红、庞氏利息的概念，看来今天还得补充一个庞氏工资的概念。</p> <p><b>投资之巅：</b>他们会说投行工资要与国际接轨，不然留不住人！<img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b409e4b2c3d33fe4dbf9.png\" /></p> <p><b>马靖昊：</b>当一个行业有泡沫时，最大的泡沫就是在人才。诸如。“上亿年终奖”，“500万年薪挖不到一个副总裁”。</p> <p>那么，<b>什么是庞氏工资呢？</b></p> <p>我认为，如果一家上市公司自从IPO以来，它的高管和员工的工资一直远远高于社会平均工资，而其用于工资的现金中有一部分来自于筹资活动流入的现金，而不是全部来自于企业自身经营活动流入的现金，这部分依靠筹资活动流入的现金来支付过高的工资，在客观上符合庞氏骗局的特点，此即庞氏工资。</p> <p><b>罗天阔：</b>庞氏工资，有创意的名字。<img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png\" /><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png\" /><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png\" /><b>黄珏老鹅2021：</b>这个思考角度让中金尴尬了。<img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40b9172ca533fe43b4c.png\" /><b>马靖昊：</b>我没有说它们是庞氏工资，只是提出一个概念。</p> <p><b>把握庞氏工资的要点：</b></p> <p>1.过高的工资；2.来源于筹资的部分。</p> <p><b>谁偷走了我的鱼缸：</b>庞氏分红和庞氏利息也是来源于筹资吗？<b>马靖昊：</b>是的，如果一家上市公司自从IPO以来，其用于分红的现金中有一部分来自于筹资活动流入的现金，这部分依靠筹资活动流入的现金来支付的分红，在客观上符合庞氏骗局的特点，此即庞氏分红。同理，当企业支付利息的现金中有一部分来自于筹资活动流入的现金，则此为庞氏利息。</p> <p><b>力量自然：</b>A股已经毫无底线，完全沦陷为诈骗市场。<br/><b>马靖昊：</b>也不能这么说，但<b>股市确实出现过&#34;庞氏骗局&#34;</b>，以造假和配股为中心的&#34;股市庞氏骗局&#34;可用以下循环概括：操纵利润→抬高股价→增发配股→圈得现金→提高信用等级→申请银行贷款→继续操纵利润，一直循环下去。操纵利润既是为了从股民手中圈钱，又是为了从银行手中圈钱，但从银行圈来的钱最终会以从股民圈来的钱来偿还。最后再给大伙总结一下，如果一家企业经营活动现金净流量根本无法满足企业自身<b>所谓的分红、付息、工资，</b>只能依靠融资活动和“体外输血”来驱动增长，即为<b>庞氏分红、庞氏利息与庞氏工资</b>。</p> <p>用精炼的语言阐述深刻的财务逻辑，如文章得到您的认可，<b>希望您看完后分享到“朋友圈”或者点一下右下角的“在看”</b><b>，</b>以示鼓励。长期坚持原创不易，多次想放弃，坚持是一种信仰，专注是一种态度 ，一路陪伴，一起地老天荒，谢谢。</p> <p></p> <p><b>推荐阅读</b></p> <p>账款能收尽收，能晚付尽量晚付。如果大家都这样做，金钱还有流动吗？</p> <p>企业造血与失血：<a href=\"https://xueqiu.com/S/SZ980092?from=status_stock_match\" class=\"xq_stock\">自由现金流</a>的分析</p> <p>净资产收益率！！！</p> <p>如何计算企业的真实赚钱能力？</p> <p>“按需”报送财务报告风险极大</p> <p>如同化验血液，对于企业，可以检测一下它的收现比、净现比、分红融资比！</p>","show_cover_pic":true,"legal_user_visible":false,"is_column":false,"recommend_cards":null,"is_ss_multi_pic":false,"is_bonus":false,"cover_pic":"","pic":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40965b2c1ea3fa51ee8.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b409e4b2c3d33fe4dbf9.png,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40a2b52c1eb3fe950b8.png,https://xqimg.imedao.com/1836b40b9172ca533fe43b4c.png","answer_question":false,"is_no_archive":false,"is_original_declare":false,"mp_not_show_status":false,"forbidden_comment":false,"is_private":false}